---
title: "Backrooms"
note: "An endless found-footage walk through the Backrooms: empty, ordinary places that go on for ever, filmed on a 1990s camcorder with the same date stamp in every clip. Each clip starts in the yellow rooms or wherever the last one fell, walks through a new level and noclips out in its final second (through a wall, the floor, a door, the dark, deep water, an elevator, a vent, tape static). Sometimes something happens far away. The fluorescent hum does the rest. Loop it on Motion Context with Run (Instant)."
tags: [loops, h3, reel, motion_context, horror]
---
@h3 t2va 16:9
context: 22
style: found footage from a 1990s VHS camcorder, one continuous unbroken ten-second shot: soft smeared colour, faint tracking lines, the date stamp "JUN 14 1996 3:12 AM" in the lower corner, handheld at chest height and swaying gently with each step
MUSIC: N/A

